<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Welcome to My Website</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Cambria, serif;
    font-size:14px;
}

body{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d8f3ff,#9ddcff,#d8f3ff);
    min-height:100vh;
    text-align:center;
}

/* Header */
header{
    background:#0057b8;
    color:white;
    padding:25px;
    box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
}

header h1{
    font-size:34px;
}

/* Scrolling Text */
.notice{
    width:100%;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:#003d99;
    color:white;
    padding:12px 0;
}

.notice span{
    display:inline-block;
    white-space:nowrap;
    padding-left:100%;
    animation:scroll 12s linear infinite;
    font-weight:bold;
}

@keyframes scroll{
    from{transform:translateX(0);}
    to{transform:translateX(-200%);}
}

/* Hero Section */
.hero{
    margin:40px auto;
    width:85%;
    background:white;
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:40px;
    box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
}

.hero h2{
    color:#0057b8;
    font-size:28px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.hero p{
    color:#444;
    line-height:1.8;
}

/* Button */
button{
    margin-top:25px;
    background:#0057b8;
    color:white;
    border:none;
    padding:14px 35px;
    border-radius:30px;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:.4s;
}

button:hover{
    background:#003d99;
    transform:scale(1.08);
}

/* Grid Cards */
.grid{
    width:90%;
    margin:40px auto;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
    gap:25px;
}

.card{
    background:white;
    padding:30px;
    border-radius:18px;
    box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
    transition:.4s;
}

.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-10px);
    background:#0057b8;
    color:white;
}

.card h3{
    font-size:22px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

/* Footer */
footer{
    margin-top:30px;
    background:#0057b8;
    color:white;
    padding:20px;
}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
</header>

<div class="notice">
    <span>★ Welcome to my creative website • Learn HTML • Learn CSS • Build Amazing Web Pages ★</span>
</div>

<div class="hero">
    <h2>Creative Web Design</h2>
    <p>
        This webpage demonstrates HTML and CSS features including
        light blue background, animated scrolling text,
        blue themed design, Cambria font,
        responsive grid layout and interactive button.
    </p>

    <button>Explore More</button>
</div>

<div class="grid">

    <div class="card">
        <h3>🌐 HTML</h3>
        <p>Build the structure of a webpage.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>🎨 CSS</h3>
        <p>Add attractive colors and layouts.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>⚡ Animation</h3>
        <p>Create smooth scrolling and hover effects.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>📱 Responsive</h3>
        <p>Looks good on desktops and mobile devices.</p>
    </div>

</div>

<footer>
    © 2026 | Designed by Alan
</footer>

</body>
</html>
